Package: ggvmap
Title: Voronoi Map Treemaps for ggplot2
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Loukas", "Theodosiou", email = "loukesio@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compute and visualise Voronoi map treemaps -- space-filling
    partitions of convex polygons where each cell's area is proportional to
    an underlying weight. The algorithm iteratively adapts site positions and
    power-diagram weights until convergence, following the approach of Nocaj
    and Brandes (2012) <doi:10.1111/j.1467-8659.2012.03078.x>. Supports
    hierarchical (grouped) layouts, a decorative outer annotation ring, and
    flag / image / value annotations. Pure R implementation with no compiled-code
    dependencies and first-class ggplot2 integration.
